Package: rppx
Title: Data Analysis Toolkit for Pre-Normalized Reverse Phase Protein
    Array Data
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo Sabino", "de Camargo Magalhães", , "escmagalhaes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7726-4827"))
Description: Designed to work with pre-normalized data derived from
    Reverse Phase Protein Arrays (RPPA), downstream of RPPASPACE. Provides
    a compendium of functions related to analytical pipelines with
    graphical visualization and figure generation: quality control,
    hierarchical clustering, protein-protein correlation, differential
    protein expression, pathway enrichment (via EnrichR or customized),
    protein networks (via Cytoscape), univariate and multivariate Cox
    Proportional Hazards models, descriptive tables, plotting functions
    (mainly via ggplot2 and ComplexHeatmap) and data exporting functions.
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/escmagalhaes/rppx
BugReports: https://github.com/escmagalhaes/rppx/issues
